    "description": "<p>You have numerous devices stashed in your tech kit or armor. When you complete a rest, place a number of tokens on this card equal to your Tier. You may spend a token to:</p><ul><li><p>Make an adversary temporarily <em>Vulnerable</em>.</p></li><li><p>Make an adversary temporarily <em>Restrained</em>.</p></li><li><p>Move an adversary from Melee to Close range, or Close to Melee range.</p></li></ul><p>Unspent tokens are cleared when you rest.</p>",
